7. Why modular monolith first?

Because KnowledgeOS has an unusual property:

The logical boundaries are clearer than the runtime boundaries.

We know:

$$ L0,L1,L2,L3,L4,L5,L6 $$

but we don't yet know which deserve independent deployment.

Microservices now would introduce:

distributed transactions;
network failure;
version skew;
serialization issues;
distributed tracing;
consistency problems.

before we know whether they are necessary.

Therefore:

$$ \boxed{ Discover\ runtime\ boundaries\ from\ domain\ pressure, not\ from\ theoretical\ layers. } $$
