10. What is a Contract?

A Contract is a machine-readable specification of conditions under which an operation or assessment is valid.

Generic form:

$$ Contract= (Input, Preconditions, Rules, Postconditions, Scope, Assumptions, FailureModes, Version). $$

Example:

EvidenceValidityContract
------------------------
EvidenceType = Document
SourceRequired = true
TemporalValidityRequired = true
ProvenanceRequired = true

This is executable architecture, not merely documentation.

