67. The most important DDD conclusion

KnowledgeOS itself should not become one giant aggregate.

And KnowledgeOS should not become one giant bounded context containing everything.

Instead:

$$ \boxed{ KnowledgeOS = Shared\ Epistemic\ Infrastructure } $$

with strongly bounded internal domain models.

Domain applications such as:

